meta {
  name: Deliver
  type: http
  seq: 20
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/order/{{orderId}}/deliver
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  ## Deliver Order

  Seller marks an ACTIVE order as DELIVERED.

  ### Transitions
  ACTIVE → DELIVERED

  ### Variables
  | Variable | Description |
  |----------|-------------|
  | orderId  | Order UUID  |

  ### Headers
  | Header        | Value               | Required |
  |---------------|---------------------|----------|
  | Authorization | Bearer {{authToken}}| ✅       |

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Order marked as delivered",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```

  ### Error Responses
  - **400** — Order not ACTIVE / Not the seller
  - **401** — Missing/invalid token
}
